        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "🏡 TO LET – COUNTY MAYO | €2,300 PER MONTH\r\n\r\nSpacious 227 sq. m. Detached Bungalow | Available Immediately\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to rent this impressive 227 sq. m. detached bungalow, situated in a beautiful countryside setting in County Mayo, close to the iconic Croagh Patrick Mountain.\r\n\r\nThe property offers generous living accommodation together with a peaceful rural setting, ideal for those looking for a spacious home surrounded by the beauty of the West of Ireland.\r\n\r\n✨ 227 sq. m. detached bungalow\r\n✨ Spacious accommodation\r\n✨ Beautiful countryside location\r\n✨ Close to Croagh Patrick Mountain\r\n✨ Available immediately\r\n✨ 12-month rental\r\n✨ €2,300 per month\r\n✨ 1 month's deposit required\r\n\r\nAdditional details:\r\n\r\n- 1 living room\r\n- Conservatory area\r\n- Laundry room\r\n- Oil heating\r\n- Rent: €2,300 per month\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
